"use strict";(self.webpackChunkdocs=self.webpackChunkdocs||[]).push([[1477],{10:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"blogPosts":[{"id":"dev-portal-refresh","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/dev-portal-refresh","editUrl":"https://github.com/sesamiapp/devportal/edit/master/blog/blog/2026-05-01-dev-portal-refresh.md","source":"@site/blog/2026-05-01-dev-portal-refresh.md","title":"A fresh look for sesami.dev","description":"We\'ve given sesami.dev a refresh \u2014 a clearer story of what the platform offers, and faster paths into the parts of Sesami you actually want to build with.","date":"2026-05-01T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"May 1, 2026","tags":[{"label":"docs","permalink":"/blog/tags/docs"},{"label":"platform","permalink":"/blog/tags/platform"},{"label":"sesami","permalink":"/blog/tags/sesami"}],"readingTime":1.57,"hasTruncateMarker":true,"authors":[{"name":"Ehsan","title":"Engineer @ Sesami","url":"https://github.com/sesamiapp"}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"dev-portal-refresh","title":"A fresh look for sesami.dev","author":"Ehsan","author_title":"Engineer @ Sesami","author_url":"https://github.com/sesamiapp","tags":["docs","platform","sesami"]},"nextItem":{"title":"Welcome","permalink":"/blog/welcome"}},"content":"We\'ve given **sesami.dev** a refresh \u2014 a clearer story of what the platform offers, and faster paths into the parts of Sesami you actually want to build with.\\n\\n![Sesami Developers \u2014 refreshed homepage](/img/sesami-dev-refreshed.png)\\n\\n\x3c!--truncate--\x3e\\n\\n### What\'s new\\n\\n**A homepage that explains the platform.** Instead of a generic \\"welcome\\" banner, the new homepage opens with what Sesami actually does \u2014 *\\"Sesami powers service commerce\\"* \u2014 and a card grid of every product (Experience, SDK, API, Flows, Apps) you can build with.\\n\\n**Three live showcases.** Below the cards, three side-by-side code samples show the most exciting use of each major surface:\\n\\n- **Experience** \u2014 add booking to your store in 3 lines of HTML.\\n- **SDK** \u2014 build your own booking UI on top of Sesami\'s primitives.\\n- **API** \u2014 query upcoming bookings (and everything else) over GraphQL.\\n\\nCopy-paste-ready, all the way down.\\n\\n**Clearer navigation.** The top nav now has direct shortcuts to each product (Experience \xb7 SDK \xb7 API \xb7 Flows \xb7 Apps) with active-section highlighting. The docs landing page has a card grid showing what\'s inside each product so you can jump straight to a sub-topic.\\n\\n**Restructured docs.** The product order now follows the natural developer journey: *Experience \u2192 SDK \u2192 API \u2192 Flows \u2192 Apps*. The Experience section gained a new **Methods** page documenting `openExperience()` and a **Custom button** recipe for full styling control.\\n\\n**Refined typography.** Aligned with the broader Sesami brand, with sizing and spacing tuned for long-form reading.\\n\\n### What\'s next\\n\\nThis refresh is the foundation, not the destination. We\'re following up with:\\n\\n- More end-to-end examples in the Experience and SDK docs.\\n- A proper API reference with searchable endpoint docs.\\n- Embedded interactive playgrounds for the SDK.\\n\\nIf something looks off, or you\'d like a topic we don\'t cover yet, the docs are open source \u2014 [open an issue or send a PR on the devportal repo](https://github.com/sesamiapp/devportal).\\n\\nHappy building."},{"id":"welcome","metadata":{"permalink":"/blog/welcome","editUrl":"https://github.com/sesamiapp/devportal/edit/master/blog/blog/2020-04-17-welcome.md","source":"@site/blog/2020-04-17-welcome.md","title":"Welcome","description":"We\'re working hard to make dev experience as great as Sesami app itself.","date":"2020-04-17T00:00:00.000Z","formattedDate":"April 17, 2020","tags":[{"label":"hello","permalink":"/blog/tags/hello"},{"label":"sesami","permalink":"/blog/tags/sesami"},{"label":"tech","permalink":"/blog/tags/tech"}],"readingTime":0.13,"hasTruncateMarker":false,"authors":[{"name":"Ramtin","title":"Co-founder and tech lead @ Sesami","url":"https://github.com/rmtngh","imageURL":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20207426?v=4"}],"frontMatter":{"slug":"welcome","title":"Welcome","author":"Ramtin","author_title":"Co-founder and tech lead @ Sesami","author_url":"https://github.com/rmtngh","author_image_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20207426?v=4","tags":["hello","sesami","tech"]},"prevItem":{"title":"A fresh look for sesami.dev","permalink":"/blog/dev-portal-refresh"}},"content":"We\'re working hard to make dev experience as great as Sesami app itself.\\nSesami is not just another app, We are **\\"The Booking Platform For Commerce\\"**"}]}')}}]);